  m_text: 'BushDush!


    Clear all the dshes before time runs out!


    Move:
    WASD / Arrow Keys

    Pick Up / Put Dpwn: Space


    Carry up to 3 dishes at
    a time.

    Take the dishes to the sink.


    Watch out for customers!

    Hitting
    a customer costs you 5 seconds.


    Press Enter to Start'
